OL,3,GNEWSABetty the 'cold-stunned' turtle
OL,4,Aset for Azores release
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare loggerhead turtle found
OL,7,F"cold-stunned" after coastal storms is
OL,8,Fpreparing to return to the sea after
OL,9,Fseven months of recovery and
OL,10,Frehabilitation.
OL,12,FNamed Betty by her carers, the turtle
OL,13,Fwas mistaken for "debris" on Dunwich
OL,14,Fbeach in Suffolk by a member of the
OL,15,Fpublic in February who called the
OL,16,FBritish Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,17,F(BDMLR).
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37702
SC,0002
