PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1790315768
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABetty the 'cold-stunned' turtle
OL,4,Aset for Azores release
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was transferred to Hunstanton Sea
OL,7,FLife Centre in Norfolk, where a second
OL,8,Floggerhead turtle, called Olive, has
OL,9,Fbeen under care since December. Both
OL,10,Fwill travel to the Azores later this
OL,11,Fmonth for release.
OL,13,FKatie Robertson, display supervisor at
OL,14,Fthe centre, said: "The moment they
OL,15,Ffinally get released is going to be an
OL,16,Femotional time for us."
